direction: right
title: Delta Live Tables (DLT) Declarative Pipeline

RawStream: 1. Raw Storage Stream {
  style.stroke: "#38BDF8"
  AutoLoader: Auto Loader (cloudFiles)
}

Bronze: 2. Bronze DLT Table {
  style.stroke: "#FBBF24"
  Table: orders_bronze (Raw Append-Only)
}

Silver: 3. Silver DLT Table {
  style.stroke: "#34D399"
  Expectations: DLT Expectations (warn, drop, fail)
  CleanTable: orders_silver (Deduplicated & Validated)
  Expectations -> CleanTable
}

Gold: 4. Gold Business Mart {
  style.stroke: "#C084FC"
  Mart: sales_summary_gold (Materialized KPI View)
}

RawStream.AutoLoader -> Bronze.Table: @dlt.table readStream { style.stroke: "#FBBF24" }
Bronze.Table -> Silver.Expectations: @dlt.read("orders_bronze") { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
Silver.CleanTable -> Gold.Mart: @dlt.read("orders_silver") { style.stroke: "#C084FC" }
